.TH devin-plugins-update 1  "update " 
.SH NAME
devin\-plugins\-update \- Re\-fetch and re\-install a plugin (or all plugins) at the latest HEAD
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin plugins update\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Re\-fetch and re\-install a plugin (or all plugins) at the latest HEAD
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
The plugin to update; omit to update all installed plugins
